    <description><![CDATA[<h2 id="docker">Docker</h2>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-bash">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">apt-get install git</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h2 id="git-配置文件">git 配置文件</h2>
<p><code>git</code> 配置文件有三个：</p>
<ol>
<li><code>/etc/gitconfig</code> 是系统级配置文件，使用 <code>git config --system</code> 命令进行修改。</li>
<li><code>~/.gitconfig</code> 或 <code>~/.config/git/config</code> 是用户级配置文件，使用 <code>git config --global</code> 命令进行修改。</li>
<li><code>local_dir/.git/config</code> 是仓库级配置文件，使用 <code>git config --local</code> 命令进行修改。</li>
</ol>
<h3 id="设置用户信息">设置用户信息</h3>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-bash">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">$ git config --global user.name <span class="s2">&#34;username&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">$ git config --global user.email username@example.com</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h3 id="设置-git-默认编辑器">设置 git 默认编辑器</h3>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-bash">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">git config --global core.editor emacs</span></span></code></pre></div></div>]]></description>
